587
00:38:17,635 --> 00:38:19,502
Oh, no.

588
00:38:19,536 --> 00:38:22,270
D... Esto es lo único que faltaba.

589
00:38:24,578 --> 00:38:26,678
Mamá, papá.

590
00:38:26,713 --> 00:38:28,180
¿Cómo va todo?

591
00:38:28,214 --> 00:38:30,649
Jesse, no...

592
00:38:30,683 --> 00:38:32,717
